%20a%20pod.%20Please%20confirm%20availability%20for%20%5Bdates%5D.\";\n40\t\n41\tconst directBenefits = [\n42\t  {\n43\t    icon: \"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\",\n44\t    title: \"No Platform Fees\",\n45\t    description: \"Save on OTA commissions — get the best rate guaranteed\",\n46\t  },\n47\t  {\n48\t    icon: \"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\",\n49\t    title: \"Instant Confirmation\",\n50\t    description: \"Get confirmed within minutes via WhatsApp reply\",\n51\t  },\n52\t  {\n53\t    icon: \"M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h10a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm7-5a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z\",\n54\t    title: \"Pay at Arrival\",\n55\t    description: \"No credit card needed — pay cash or card when you check in\",\n56\t  },\n57\t  {\n58\t    icon: \"M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z\",\n59\t    title: \"Personal Service\",\n60\t    description: \"Chat directly with Jay or Alston — real people, real answers\",\n61\t  },\n62\t];\n63\t\n64\tconst houseRules = [\n65\t  { rule: \"Check-in from 2:00 PM\", icon: \"M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" },\n66\t  { rule: \"Check-out by 12:00 PM\", icon: \"M17 16l4-4m0 0l-4-4m4 4H7m6 4v1a3 3 0 01-3 3H6a3 3 0 01-3-3V7a3 3 0 013-3h4a3 3 0 013 3v1\" },\n67\t  { rule: \"No smoking indoors\", icon: \"M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636\" },\n68\t  { rule: \"Quiet hours: 11 PM – 7 AM\", icon: \"M5.586 15H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h1.586l4.707-4.707C10.923 3.663 12 4.109 12 5v14c0 .891-1.077 1.337-1.707.707L5.586 15z\" },\n69\t  { rule: \"Valid ID required at check-in\", icon: \"M10 6H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v9a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-5m-4 0V5